es sideways, never moves up or down, never drifts and never re-centers the composition, and the scale of every element stays exactly the same in all frames. The exposure is completely constant and locked throughout the whole video, with the same brightness, the same contrast, the same color temperature, the same saturation and the same light direction in every single frame, all light sources holding a steady even output and all highlights and shadows staying exactly as they are in <Picture 1>, so the image never gets brighter, never gets darker, never flickers, never pulses, never glows and never shifts color at any moment. Every movement in this video is extremely subtle and extremely slow, unfolding at a calm dreamlike pace with tiny amplitude, so faint that a casual viewer would first read the frame as a still image and only then notice it quietly breathing. From 00:00.000 a few delicate accents of life appear in the scene, each one small, slow and local, adding a quiet touch of atmosphere without changing the picture: wherever the poster already shows thin haze, mist, smoke or drifting cloud, a small amount of it curls and floats at a very slow speed with very small amplitude within its own existing area, staying thin and translucent so the background behind it remains fully readable; wherever the poster already shows water, its surface flows and ripples very gently and very slowly inside its own outline, holding the original water level and shoreline with only faint slow-moving reflections on it; and a light breeze passes softly and slowly through the scene so that slender branches, blossoms, leaves, loose fabric, ribbons and freely hanging ornaments sway with barely noticeable amplitude at a gentle unhurried tempo around their fixed attachment points. Every one of these accents keeps a steady, even, low-speed rhythm from beginning to end, with no sudden gust, no quick flutter, no acceleration and no burst of activity at any moment. These accents stay in the background and in small corners of the frame as gentle highlights, they never spread across the composition, never grow in density, never drift over the calligraphy or the main subjects, and every solid object, structure, main subject and text area stays perfectly still. At 00:05.000 the camera holds a static shot at the same constant exposure as the haze, the water and the breeze reach their first soft extreme at the same slow pace, all text remaining completely motionless and pixel-sharp. At 00:10.000 the camera holds a static shot at the same constant exposure as these accents drift slowly back through their opening state and continue into the second half of the same unhurried cycle, the background and the calligraphy still identical to <Picture 1>. At 00:15.000 the camera is still holding the same static shot with the original framing and the identical brightness of <Picture 1>, and every drifting wisp, every ripple and every swaying detail arrives back at exactly the position, shape, density and slow speed it had at 0.00 seconds, still moving gently and never slowing down or stopping, so the final frame matches the first frame and the video loops seamlessly. Throughout the whole video the movement stays minimal, slow and local, never travels across the frame and never passes over any text.\n\noverall_soundscape: Complete silence, an empty quiet room tone with no speech, no voices and no sound effects.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: No music at all, no instruments, no melody and no ending note, the entire 15-second video stays silent.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [593, 594], "label": "输出", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "denoised_output", "links": [], "label": "降噪输出", "type": "LATENT", "lo